:: RobinTemple Evaluation
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Jordan 2>><<person1>>
<<if $templePromised isnot ''>>
  <<robin-temple-promise-blocked>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif $RobinTemple.stage isnot 'member' or $robinromance isnot 1 or $RobinTemple.punish
  or $temple_rank is undefined or $temple_rank is 'prospective'
  or maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith lt -20 or Time.dayState is 'night' or Time.dayState is 'dusk'
  or ($RobinTemple.evaluation_day gte 0 and Time.days lt $RobinTemple.evaluation_day + 30)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The evaluation must wait until Jordan is available, you are both full members, and the waiting period has ended.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      评估需要等约旦到场、你们都成为正式成员，并且等待期结束后才能开始。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return', '返回'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if !$robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
        You tell Robin you're ready. <<He>> takes a deep breath, and the pair of you approach Jordan.
        <br><br>
        <<nnpc_He "Jordan">> turns to greet you as you near. "Welcome back," <<nnpc_he "Jordan">> says. Robin's grip on your hand tightens.
        <br><br>
        "W-we have something to ask," Robin stammers. You give <<him>> a reassuring look, and <<his>> hesitation eases. "We... I mean, we love each other. So we wanted to ask about... about the First Vow. Whether we could..." Robin trails off and looks down, <<his>> face heating up. Jordan smiles.
        <br><br>
        "I understand. You know the rules, Robin. A union of two of our members will be permitted if, and only if, the love between the two is deemed to be absolutely pure of heart, and they undergo a rite of promise or marriage. Now, you're both still in school, yes? I'd personally advise against marriage at this time."
        <br><br>
        You can feel Robin's pulse through <<his>> hand. "Y-yes. We agree." <<He>> steps forward, and motions for you to do the same. "We'd like to be evaluated. For the rite."
      <<else>>
        You tell Robin you're ready. The two of you approach Jordan again. "Welcome back," <<nnpc_he "Jordan">> says. "I take it you're here to be evaluated again?" You both nod.
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      Jordan gives you both a solemn smile. "Please come with me. You're both up to date on your chastity exams, so we can skip that step. For now." <<nnpc_He "Jordan">> begins to lead you out of the main hall and into a small room.
      <br><br>
      <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Records'>><<pass 5>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_day to Time.days>><</lanLink>>
      <br>

    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if !$robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
        你告诉罗宾你准备好了。<<He>>听罢深吸一口气，和你一起走向约旦。
        <br><br>
        约旦见你们走来，向你们打招呼。“欢迎回来。”罗宾紧紧握住了你的手。
        <br><br>
        “我、我们有件事想问问，”罗宾断断续续地说着。你给了<<him>>一个安抚的目光，<<he>>的迟疑缓和了些。“我们……我是说，我们爱着彼此。所以想问问……关于第一誓约的事。能不能……”罗宾说不下去，埋下了头，脸唰的一下变红了。约旦笑了。
        <br><br>
        “我明白了。你也知道规矩，罗宾。两个人的结合，要神殿认定你们之间的爱纯洁无瑕，还要走过结为伴侣或成婚的仪式，才能得到许可。你们俩都还在上学，对吧？我个人建议不要在这个时候结婚。”
        <br><br>
        你能感受到罗宾手掌下跳动的脉搏。“是、是的，我们想好了，”<<He>>拉着你一起向前一步，“我们想参加承诺仪式的评估。”
      <<else>>
        你告诉罗宾你准备好了，于是你们再次走向约旦。“欢迎回来，”<<nnpc_he "Jordan">>说，“我想你们是来进行评估的吧？”你们点点头。
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      约旦对你们露出庄严的微笑。“请随我来。你们二人都按期通过了贞洁测试，这一步便可暂且略去。”<<nnpc_He "Jordan">>领着你们步出大厅，步入一间静室。
      <br><br>
      <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Records'>><<pass 5>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_day to Time.days>><</lanLink>>
      <br>

  <</language>>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Records
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks to 0>>

    <<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>><<generate3>><<person3>>
    "The evaluation will focus on the aspects of your bond with each other, as well as your individual contributions to the order," Jordan explains as <<person2>><<he>> shuts the door behind you. <<He>> motions for you and Robin to take seats at an ornate table as <<he>> produces a small notebook from <<his>> robes.
    <<if $robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
      "You've already answered these questions, but since this is a fresh evaluation, I must repeat them."
    <<else>>
      <<set $robinSeen.pushUnique("evaluation")>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $RobinTemple.grace gte 90>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='green'>Robin's answers please Jordan.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 75>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='teal'>Jordan approves of Robin's contribution.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 60>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 2>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='lblue'>Jordan acknowledges Robin's contribution.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <<else>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
      Jordan asks about your devotion to the temple. <span class='red'>Jordan questions Robin's contribution.</span> <<He>> turns to ask you the same questions.
    <</if>>
    <br>

    <br>
    <<if $grace gte 90>>
      "Your devotion is remarkable, as has been proven in the past. <span class="green">You're a credit to our faith, and every one of us could learn from you.</span> I have faith that you will pass this evaluation already, but we must continue on."
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 50>>
      "<span class="teal">You've been an upstanding member of our faith.</span> I trust your words."
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 1>>
      "<span class="lblue">You've been a satisfactory member of our faith.</span> I trust your dedication, but you must strive for improvement still."
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
    <<else>>
      <span class="red">"I question your true devotion,"</span> <<he>> says. "We know you can do better."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $worn.head.name.includes("rose wedding") or $worn.upper.name.includes("rose wedding")>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<He>> runs <<his>> thumb against the roses on your clothes. "While not necessarily appropriate for this Rite, I can appreciate that you're wearing your heart on your sleeve with this wedding attire."
      <br><br>
      Robin blushes and looks away. "I... I'd like to see that again. Some day."
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    Jordan produces a small bell from <<his>> robes, and rings it four times. <<person3>>An older <<monk>> enters the room, and nods to Jordan. "Please stand," the <<monk>> says.
    <<He>> examines Robin very closely, although <<person1>><<he>> shows no discomfort.<<person3>>
    <br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith gte 20>>
      "<span class="green">You are as pure as the day you joined us,</span> <<nnpc_brother "Robin">> Robin. May you stay this way forevermore," the <<monk>> says through a hearty smile.
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<else>>
      "<span class="blue">I sense your purity has begun to slip,</span> <<nnpc_brother "Robin">> Robin. Take care that your love for this <<temple_title>> does not corrupt you." Robin flinches at <<his>> words.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    The <<monk>> approaches you.
    <br><br>
    <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Belief'>><</lanLink>>
    <br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks to 0>>

    <<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>><<generate3>><<person3>>
    “评估会考察你们彼此间的羁绊，以及各自对修会的奉献。”约旦一边解释，一边随手带上身后的门。<<person2>><<He>>示意你和罗宾在一张雕花长桌前入座，自己从长袍中取出一本小册子。
    <<if $robinSeen.includes("evaluation")>>
      “虽然你们之前已经回答过这些问题，但既然这是全新的评估，我仍须按例重问一遍。”
    <<else>>
      <<set $robinSeen.pushUnique("evaluation")>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $RobinTemple.grace gte 90>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='green'>罗宾的回答让约旦十分满意。</span><<He>>转向你，问了相同的问题。
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 75>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='teal'>约旦认可罗宾的贡献。</span><<He>>转向你，问了相同的问题。
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.grace gte 60>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 2>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='lblue'>约旦承认罗宾的贡献。</span><<He>>转向你，问了相同的问题。
    <<else>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
      约旦开始询问你们对神殿的奉献。<span class='red'>约旦对罗宾的奉献心存质疑。</span><<He>>转向你，问了相同的问题。
    <</if>>
    <br>

    <<if $grace gte 90>>
      “你过往的虔诚有口皆碑，对此毋庸置疑。<span class="green">你是信徒中的楷模，每个人都该向你学习。</span>我相信你定能通过这次评估，但规矩依旧得遵守。”
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 50>>
      “<span class="teal">你一直是我们信仰中令人敬重的信徒，</span>我相信你的话。”
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $grace gte 1>>
      “<span class="lblue">你一直是我们信仰里恪尽职守的信徒。</span>我认可你的奉献，但你仍当精进修行。”
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
    <<else>>
      <span class="red">“我对你是否真心奉献心存疑虑，”</span><<he>>说道，“我们都清楚你本可以做得更好。”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<if $worn.head.name.includes("rose wedding") or $worn.upper.name.includes("rose wedding")>>
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<He>>用拇指轻轻摩挲着你衣物上的玫瑰花纹，“虽然这身婚纱在这场仪式上并不合规矩，但我能明白，你这是把满腔心意都毫无保留地穿在了身上。”
      <br><br>
      罗宾红了脸，把视线移向一旁。“我……我真想某天能再看你穿一次。”
      <br><br>
    <</if>>
    约旦从长袍中取出一枚小铃，摇了四下。<<person3>>一个年长的<<monk>>推门而入，向约旦颔首。“请起立。”<<monk>>说道。
    <<He>>仔细打量着罗宾，而<<person1>><<he>>神色坦然，未显丝毫不适。<<person3>>
    <br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith gte 20>>
      “<span class="green">你还是和刚来那天一样纯洁，</span><<nnpc_brother "Robin">>罗宾。愿你永远保持这般无瑕，”<<monk>>露出宽厚的微笑。
      <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<else>>
      “<span class="blue">我感到你的纯洁正在动摇，</span><<nnpc_brother "Robin">>罗宾。千万小心，莫让你对这位<<temple_title>>的倾慕将你引向堕落。”罗宾被<<his>>的话刺痛，畏缩了一下。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    修道士转而朝你走来。
    <br><br>
    <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Belief'>><</lanLink>>
    <br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Belief
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<He>> begins to look you over.
    <<if $angel gte 6>>
      <<His>> eyes slowly widen, and after a moment, <<he>> steps back and regards you with awe. "<span class="gold">This one is... radiant.</span> A true beacon of purity." <<He>> turns to Jordan. "I have faith that this one will take the vow seriously." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $fallenangel gte 2 or $demon gte 6>>
      <<He>> slowly frowns. "<span class="red">This one is... dirty.</span> Tragic."
      <<if $fallenangel gte 2 and $forgiveintro is 1>>
        <br><br>
        Jordan smiles faintly. "<<pShe>> has already confessed to me <<pher>> soil, and seeks to improve <<pherself>>. If anything, <span class="green"><<pher>> willingness to admit <<pher>> sin and desire to improve <<pherself>> is something to admire</span>."
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<else>>
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 10>>
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 999>>
      <<His>> face brightens up as <<he>> examines you head to toe. <span class="green">"Your dedication to purity is impressive."</span> <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 15>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 900>>
      <<He>> smiles as <<he>> examines you head to toe. <span class="lblue">"Your dedication to purity is commendable."</span> <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 500>>
      <<His>> expression remains stern as <<he>> examines you head to toe. "<span class="purple">Your dedication to purity is... sub-par.</span> You should strive to improve yourself."
    <<else>>
      <<He>> frowns as <<he>> regards you. <span class="red">"A pity. Your purity has faded."</span> <<He>> turns to Jordan. "This one should be made to atone before any such rite is permitted, but the decision is not mine." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    Jordan nods to the <<monk>>, who bows and leaves the room. "The next section of the examination will require you two to be separated. Please come with me." Jordan leads you into a separate, adjacent room with an identical ornate table. "Please wait here while I administer Robin's part of the exam."
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>><<npc "Robin" 1>><<person1>><<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>>
    <<lanLink ['Wait (0:15)', '等待 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Questions'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>>
    <br>
    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
    <<sneakicon>><<lanLink ['Eavesdrop on Jordan and Robin', '偷听约旦与罗宾的谈话'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop'>><</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<he>>仔细地把你打量了一番。
    <<if $angel gte 6>>
      <<His>>的眼睛缓缓睁大，片刻后，<<he>>不由自主地后退半步，敬畏地注视着你。“<span class="gold">此人……圣光萦绕。</span>当真是纯洁的灯塔。”<<He>>转向约旦，“我坚信此人必会郑重对待这份誓约。”<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 20>>
    <<elseif $fallenangel gte 2 or $demon gte 6>>
      <<His>>的眉头缓缓拧紧。“<span class="red">此人……污秽不堪。</span>真是可悲。”
      <<if $fallenangel gte 2 and $forgiveintro is 1>>
        <br><br>
        约旦露出一抹温和的微笑。“<<pShe>>已向我忏悔过过失，且心怀向善之念。若要评断，<span class="green"><<pher>>直面己罪、渴求自新的诚心实属难能可贵</span>。”
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 5>>
      <<else>>
        <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 10>>
      <</if>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 999>>
      <<He>>从头到脚审视了你一番，脸上浮现出宽慰的微笑。<span class="green">“你对纯洁的坚守着实令人钦佩。”</span><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 15>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 900>>
      <<He>>从头到脚审视了你一番，对你赞许地微微一笑。<span class="lblue">“你对纯洁的坚守值得称道。”</span><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $purity gte 500>>
      <<He>>从头到脚审视了你一番，神情始终严肃。“<span class="purple">你对纯洁的坚守……尚有欠缺。</span>你当好自自省。”
    <<else>>
      <<He>>皱着眉头审视着你。<span class="red">“甚是可惜，你身上的纯洁已然蒙尘。”</span><<He>>转向约旦，“在此等仪式获准前，理应令其先行赎罪。不过，最终决断仍在阁下。”<<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    约旦向修道士微微颔首，对方行了一礼退下。“接下来的考查需要你们二人分开进行，请随我来。”约旦领着你来到隔壁的单间，里面摆着一张同样样式的雕花木桌。“请在此稍候，我先为罗宾进行测试。”
    <br><br>
    <<endevent>><<npc "Robin" 1>><<person1>><<npc "Jordan" 2>><<person2>>
    <<lanLink ['Wait (0:15)', '等待 (0:15)'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Questions'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 1>><<pass 15>><</lanLink>>
    <br>
    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 700>>
    <<sneakicon>><<lanLink ['Eavesdrop on Jordan and Robin', '偷听约旦与罗宾的谈话'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop'>><</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Questions
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      You sit and wait for Jordan to return. You spend the time looking at the various ornate patterns carved into the table.
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 2>>
      You sit and wait for Jordan to return, helpless to do much else. You spend the time looking at the various ornate patterns carved into the table, wondering what other tricks may be hidden within.
    <<else>>
      You hear Jordan approach the door, and you quickly return to your seat.
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    Jordan enters the room, still smiling. "Apologies for the wait. Please answer me honestly, no matter the question," <<person2>><<he>> says as <<he>> sits opposite to you. <<He>> flips <<his>> notebook to a fresh page.
    <br><br>
    "Where did you and Robin grow up together?"
    <br><br>

    <<lanLink ['At the orphanage', '在孤儿院'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'orphanage'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['At school', '在学校'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'school'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ["Say you don't remember", '说你不记得了'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'forgot'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 1>>
      你独自坐着等待约旦回来，目光漫无目的地掠过桌上雕琢精细的花纹。
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase is 2>>
      你独自坐着等待约旦回来，无事可做，只得端详着桌面上繁复的雕花纹路，暗自揣摩其中是否还暗藏着什么玄机。
    <<else>>
      你听见约旦走近门口的脚步声，连忙快步跑回座位坐好。
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    约旦推门步入房间，脸上依旧带着平静的微笑。“久等了。接下来不论我问什么，请务必如实相告。”<<person2>><<he>>在你对面落座，翻开手中的小册子。
    <br><br>
    “你和罗宾是在哪里一起长大的？”
    <br><br>

    <<lanLink ['At the orphanage', '在孤儿院'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'orphanage'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ['At school', '在学校'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'school'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<lanLink ["Say you don't remember", '说你不记得了'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Answer'>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer to 'forgot'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</language>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Answer
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    <<if $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer is "orphanage">>
      Jordan nods, writing in <<his>> notebook. "Your memory serves well." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks += 10>>
    <<elseif $RobinTemple.evaluation_answer is "forgot">>
      Jordan pauses and frowns. "That seems important to remember." <<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_marks -= 5>>
    <<else>>
      Jordan pauses and frowns. "Robin told me something different."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<He>> reaches for your hand, producing a ring sizer from <<his>> robes. "I need your ring size in the event you pass." You allow <<him>> to measure your ring finger as <<he>> continues.
    <br><br>
    "Do you understand the requirements and implications of the vow of promise?" You shake your head. "It's a sacred bond between two members of our order that show pure love between one another. It allows them to be exempt from their chastity vows, but only with each other. We will know if either of you is unfaithful."
    <<He>> finds your ring size. "This bond does not protect your purity, hence the strict requirements. Such a privilege is reserved for marriage in our faith. Your chastity exams will be taken simultaneously, when possible. Should either one of you fail your chastity exam after your new vow, <span class="red">you will both be punished as one.</span>"
    <br><br>
    Jordan's face has become serious. "Tell me, my child. Are you certain it is not lust, but love that drives you to take this vow?"
    <br><br>
