          <span class="pink">随着贞操带的解除，<<= maplebirch.auto($penilechastityparasite)>>从你的阴茎上脱落下来。</span>
          <br>
          <<set $penilechastityparasite to 0>>
        <</if>>
        <<if $analchastityparasite isnot 0>>
          <span class="pink">随着贞操带的解除，<<= maplebirch.auto($analchastityparasite)>>从你的肛门掉了出来。</span>
          <br>
          <<set $analchastityparasite to 0>>
        <</if>>
        <<if playerChastity("anus")>><<set $worn.genitals.anal_shield to 0>><</if>>
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<He>>转过身去，让你从容穿戴整齐。
      <br><br>
    <<else>>
      <<set $templetest to "failed">>
      “很遗憾，你已不再洁净。”<<His>>的声音微不可察地颤抖了一下，不知是否是你的错觉。“你必须接受净化。我会召集专人前来，届时请务必配合。”<<He>>从长袍中取出一枚小铃，轻轻晃响。“为了你，罗宾不会被惩罚，也不会知晓此事。”
      <br><br>
      <<endevent>>
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $templetest is 'failed'>>
  <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Temple Arcade Intro'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Promise Rite'>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to 'approved'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<lanLink ['Ask for more time', '再考虑一段时间'] 'RobinTemple Corner'>><<set $RobinTemple.stage to 'approved'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Evaluation Eavesdrop Followup
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<effects>>
    "You understand the requirements and restrictions of the vow of promise?"
    <br>
    "Yes."
    <br>
    "Would you be willing to submit to an off-schedule chastity exam to prove your devotion and purity?"
    <br>
    "Of course."
    <br>
    "Excellent." Another pause.


    You hear something drop on the other side of the door, which startles you. You prepare to rush back to your seat, until you hear Jordan speak again.
    <br><br>
    "Will you keep your current vows until the rite is complete?" There's a pause.
    <br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith gte 20>>
      "Y-yes. I want to do this properly. We can wait."
    <<else>>
      "Y-yes. If it means we can be together, I... I'll wait."
    <</if>>
    <br>
    "Thank you for being honest. I trust your word. Your section of this evaluation is complete."
    <br><br>
    <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Questions'>><<pass 15>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 3>><</lanLink>>
    <br>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<effects>>
    “你可明白承诺誓约的要求与戒律？”
    <br>
    “明白。”
    <br>
    “那么，为了证明你的虔诚与纯洁，你可愿意接受一次例外的贞洁检验？”
    <br>
    “当然愿意。”
    <br>
    “很好。”又是一阵停顿。


    门另一头突然传来东西落地的轻响，惊得你心头一跳。你正手忙脚乱地准备退回座中，便听见约旦的声音再度响起。
    <br><br>
    “在仪式彻底礼成之前，你可愿继续坚守现有的誓约？”少顷的沉默。
    <br>
    <<if maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').faith gte 20>>
      “会、会的。我想堂堂正正地走完仪式。我们等得起。”
    <<else>>
      “会、会的。只要能让我们在一起，我……多久我都等。”
    <</if>>
    <br>
    “谢谢你的坦诚，我信任你的承诺。你这部分的考查已经完成了。”
    <br><br>
    <<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'RobinTemple Evaluation Questions'>><<pass 15>><<set $RobinTemple.evaluation_phase to 3>><</lanLink>>
    <br>
<</language>>
